     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-background-native-hawaiian-category</b></p><a name=\"ahip-background-native-hawaiian-category\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-background-native-hawaiian-category\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4\"><code>urn:oid:2.16.840.1.113883.6.238</code></a><span style=\"opacity: 0.5\" title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. When building this specification, the most recent version 1.3 has been used\"> version ⏿1.3</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2097-4\">2097-4</a></td><td>Chuukese</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2088-3\">2088-3</a></td><td>Chamorro</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2101-4\">2101-4</a></td><td>Fijian</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2078-4\">2078-4</a></td><td>Polynesian</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2090-9\">2090-9</a></td><td>Marshallese</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2079-2\">2079-2</a></td><td>Native Hawaiian</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2091-7\">2091-7</a></td><td>Palauan</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2102-2\">2102-2</a></td><td>Papua New Guinean</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2080-0\">2080-0</a></td><td>Samoan</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2082-6\">2082-6</a></td><td>Tongan</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.fhir.org/r4/ValueSet/935#935-2098-2\">2098-2</a></td><td>Yap</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 4.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?4.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.3.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://ahip.org/demographics/CodeSystem/AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.1.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html#AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-CNTR\">CNTR</a></td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient has chosen not to respond to this question at this time</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor.html#AHIP-Demo-Additional-NullFlavor-PSIN\">PSIN</a></td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td><td>**Description:**This code is to represent explicitly that the patient would like to specify a value that is not listed above</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
